React -----

    -   React is a JavaScript library created by Meta.
    -   It is used to build an fast and interactive user interafaces.
    -   It is single page application.
    -   Page does not realod , it conatin change. 
    -   Ex - intstagram, facebook.


why do we use react ----

    problem with traditional JS ------
        -   full page reload 
        -   complex DOM manipulation
        -   hard to manage large application

    By React -----
        -   update only requird parts
        -   use reusable componenets


core concept -- Virtual DOM -----

    -   react creates copy of real DOM, measn virtual DOM
    -   when data changes, react upadte virtual DOM
    -   update only changed the part in real DOM
    -   use -
            -   High performance 


vite  ---- fast build tool
npm intall ---- intall dependancies
npm run dev  ---- start sever


Step to create React project ----

step 1 --- check versions 
    node -v
    npm -v

step 2 --- 
    npx create react-app project_name ( older version )
    npm create vite@latest App_name


index.html ---
main.jsx --- 
app.jsx --- 

jsx ---- 
    -   JavaScript + xml
    -   It allows to us write html code inside the JS
    -   ex -
            const element = <h1> Hello React </h1>

Rules --- 
    1. must retrun single parent
    2. use scope brackets {} for JS


Componenets --- 
    -   It is heart of react
    -   There is one componenet --- functional componenet

functional componenet ----
ex -
    function student () {
        return <h1>This is function componenet</h1>
    }

use componenet ----
ex -
    function app() {  
        return <student/>
    }


Props (properties) -----

    -   Props means data passing from parent ( app() ) to child ( student() ).
    -   ex -
            function app() {  
                return <student fname = 'Trupti' />
            }

            function student(props) {
                return <h1>Name : {props.fname} </h2>
            }




